  "finding": "No matching genuine old Challenge whole Optional/protected Story/checkpoint plus original raw primary/backup/preferences artifact set in these named accepted O1 archives. Loading48/Root88 source captures current/checkpoint internally but does not retain them and deletes isolated Stores; native57/extremes82/portrait84 are component/Main evidence. Portrait metadata captures local/view/contact state, not whole Shell/Attempts/raw Store transport. No historical packet reconstructed.",
  "bounded_search": "Only named O1 accepted indexes, direct non-source artifact inventories, selected native result/raw/metadata and known accepted fixture source; no other bank contents or Agent02 checkout accessed."
